---
// No real Google Business Profile or verified review count exists -
// never fabricates a star average, review count, or profile link. See
// docs/GREENCAL_OWNER_VERIFICATION_REQUIRED.md.
---

<div class="review-summary">
  <p class="review-summary-status">
    Google review integration is not yet connected. Verified reviews and a live rating summary
    will appear here once available.
  </p>
  <div class="review-summary-actions">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" disabled>
      View All Reviews
    </button>
    <span class="review-summary-badge">Google Business Profile: not yet connected</span>
  </div>
  <p class="review-summary-note">
    Both will become real, working links once a verified Google Business Profile is connected -
    shown disabled here rather than as dead links.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .review-summary {
    padding: var(--space-5);
    background-color: var(--color-cream-100);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-6);
  }

  .review-summary-status {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    margin-block: 0 var(--space-4);
    color: var(--color-charcoal-600);
  }

  .review-summary-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-3);
  }

  .review-summary-actions .btn[disabled] {
    opacity: 0.55;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .review-summary-badge {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-charcoal-600);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .review-summary-note {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-charcoal-600);
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
